OL,3,GNEWSAGoogle Cloud says 'power event'
OL,4,Abehind outage hitting UK banks and
OL,5,Awebsites
OL,6,
OL,7,FGoogle Cloud has said a "power event"
OL,8,Fis behind an outage affecting a range
OL,9,Fof online services in the UK, including
OL,10,Fbanks and the courts.
OL,12,FThe company, which is one of a handful
OL,13,Fof large cloud computing providers
OL,14,Fwhose infrastructure and services are
OL,15,Fused to power millions of online
OL,16,Fplatforms, reported an "issue with
OL,17,Fmultiple services" at its UK data
OL,18,Fcentre complex "europe-west2".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
