OL,1,W5j 5Q7k jjs%wsj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGoogle Cloud says 'power event'
OL,4,Abehind outage hitting UK banks and
OL,5,Awebsites
OL,6,
OL,7,FBanks Revolut, Lloyds and Halifax are
OL,8,Famong those to report disruption to
OL,9,Ftheir apps, thought the link to the
OL,10,FGoogle Cloud outage has not been
OL,11,Fofficially confirmed.
OL,13,FGoogle Cloud has not given a clear
OL,14,Ftimeline for when the issues will be
OL,15,Fresolved but it has apologised "to all
OL,16,Fwho are affected by the disruption".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
